vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Submit Outreach Tracker
  
  Creates a new outreach tracker record. Captures details about a community outreach event including location, dates, participant counts, activity descriptions, and impact assessment.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `create` permission.
  
  ## Request Body (`application/json`)
  
  | Field                  | Type       | Required | Description                                                                     |
  |------------------------|------------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `outreachStartDate`    | date       | Yes      | Start date of the outreach (format: `YYYY-MM-DD`)                               |
  | `outreachEndDate`      | date       | Yes      | End date of the outreach (format: `YYYY-MM-DD`)                                 |
  | `outreachState`        | string     | Yes      | Nigerian state. One of the 36 states + `FCT` + `OTHER`                          |
  | `outreachLga`          | string     | Yes      | Local Government Area                                                           |
  | `outreachCity`         | string     | Yes      | City where the outreach took place                                              |
  | `outreachCommunity`    | string     | Yes      | Specific community name                                                         |
  | `numVolunteers`        | number     | Yes      | Number of volunteers involved (integer ≥ 0)                                     |
  | `numBeneficiaries`     | number     | Yes      | Number of beneficiaries reached (integer ≥ 0)                                   |
  | `outreachType`         | string[]   | Yes      | Array of types: `SOFT SKILLS`, `VOCATIONAL SKILLS`, `MEDICAL`, `EDUCATIONAL`    |
  | `activityDescription`  | string     | Yes      | Description of activities conducted                                             |
  | `impactStories`        | string     | No       | Notable impact stories from the outreach                                        |
  | `challengesEncountered`| string     | No       | Challenges encountered during the outreach                                      |
  | `recommendations`      | string     | No       | Recommendations for future outreaches                                           |
  | `submittedBy`          | string     | Yes      | Name of the person submitting the report                                        |
  | `submissionDate`       | date       | Yes      | Date the report was submitted (format: `YYYY-MM-DD`)                            |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created outreach tracker record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Outreach tracker created successfully",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "outreachStartDate": "2026-03-01",
      "outreachEndDate": "2026-03-05",
      "outreachState": "LAGOS",
      "outreachLga": "ikeja",
      "outreachCity": "ikeja",
      "outreachCommunity": "alausa community",
      "numVolunteers": 12,
      "numBeneficiaries": 85,
      "outreachType": ["EDUCATIONAL", "SOFT SKILLS"],
      "activityDescription": "educational workshops and soft skills training for community youth",
      "impactStories": "several beneficiaries reported improved confidence after sessions",
      "challengesEncountered": "limited space at the community hall",
      "recommendations": "secure larger venue for future outreaches",
      "submittedBy": "john doe",
      "submissionDate": "2026-03-06",
      "updatedAt": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-06-25T10:00:00.000Z",
      "deletedAt": null
    }
  }
  ```
  
  On success, all cached keys matching the pattern `cedarrise:outreaches:*` are invalidated via a `DELETE_CACHE` event.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                          |
  |-----------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation error (missing or invalid fields).        |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.             |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Authenticated user lacks `create` permission.        |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                             |
}
